#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:1
msgid "RTK 工作方式与手册结构"
msgstr "RTK Operation and Guide Structure"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "先理解两个选择维度"
msgstr "First, understand the two dimensions of choice"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:6
msgid ""
"**产品形态**选择 D20 轻量化四臂螺旋一体化接收机或 D13 紧凑型一体化接收机；**"
"差分链路**选择 4G 或 LoRa。4G 版本为移动站，LoRa 版本按移动站套件交付，并包含"
"配套 D13 LoRa 基站及附件。"
msgstr ""
"**Form factor**: choose the lightweight D20 integrated receiver with a "
"quadrifilar helix antenna (QHA), or the compact D13 integrated receiver. "
"**Correction link**: choose 4G or LoRa. The 4G version is a rover; the LoRa "
"version is delivered as a base-and-rover kit that includes a dedicated D13 "
"LoRa base station and accessories."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:9
msgid "共同工作方式"
msgstr "Ways of working together"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:11
msgid "设备接收 GPS、北斗、Galileo、QZSS、GLONASS 和 IRNSS 卫星信号。"
msgstr ""
"The device receives GPS, BeiDou, Galileo, QZSS, GLONASS, and IRNSS satellite "
"signals."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:12
msgid "设备通过 4G/CORS 或本地 LoRa 链路获得差分数据。"
msgstr ""
"The device obtains correction data through a 4G/CORS or local LoRa link."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:13
msgid "设备内部完成 RTK 解算。"
msgstr "The device completes RTK solution computation internally."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:14
msgid "设备通过 UART 向飞控、机器人主控、Viobot2 或 PC 输出定位结果。"
msgstr ""
"The device outputs positioning results to the flight controller, robot main "
"controller, Viobot2, or PC via UART."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:16
msgid "LoRa 差分数据在基站和移动站内部链路中传输，不作为外部用户接口。"
msgstr ""
"LoRa correction data is transmitted within the internal links of the base "
"station and rover and is not used as an external user interface."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:18
msgid "4G 与 LoRa"
msgstr "4G and LoRa"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "选择"
msgstr "Choose"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "4G 版本"
msgstr "4G version"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "LoRa 版本"
msgstr "LoRa Version"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "差分来源"
msgstr "Correction source"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "CORS/NTRIP 服务"
msgstr "CORS/NTRIP Service"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "套件内 D13 LoRa 基站"
msgstr "D13 LoRa base station in the kit"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "网络要求"
msgstr "Network requirements"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "需要蜂窝网络、SIM 卡和 CORS 账号"
msgstr "Requires cellular network, SIM card, and CORS account"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "不依赖公网"
msgstr "Does not rely on the public internet"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "现场设备"
msgstr "On-site equipment"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "单个移动站"
msgstr "Single rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "移动站 + 配套基站"
msgstr "Rover + supporting base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "适合场景"
msgstr "Suitable scenarios"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "跨区域、分散作业"
msgstr "Cross-regional, dispersed operations"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:3
msgid "固定区域、自建链路"
msgstr "Fixed area, self-built link"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:27
msgid "输出固件"
msgstr "Output firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:29
msgid "通信版本决定差分数据从哪里来，固件版本决定定位结果如何向下游输出："
msgstr ""
"The communication version determines where the correction data comes from, "
"and the firmware version determines how the positioning results are output "
"to downstream."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:31
msgid "D20 地面版默认 10 Hz NMEA，面向 Viobot2、机器人主控和 PC。"
msgstr ""
"D20 ground firmware defaults to 10 Hz NMEA, aimed at Viobot2, robot main "
"control, and PC."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:32
msgid "D20 无人机版默认 10 Hz UBX，面向 ArduPilot、PX4 等飞控。"
msgstr ""
"The D20 UAV firmware defaults to 10 Hz UBX, designed for flight controllers "
"such as ArduPilot and PX4."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:33
msgid "D13 默认输出 10 Hz NMEA，可按需求配置为 UBX。"
msgstr "D13 defaults to 10 Hz NMEA and can be configured for UBX on request."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:36
msgid ""
"不要混淆通信版本与输出协议 **4G / LoRa** 决定差分数据来源，**NMEA / UBX** 决"
"定定位结果的对外输出格式，两者可以独立选择。"
msgstr ""
"Do not confuse the communication version with the output protocol. **4G / "
"LoRa** determines the source of correction data, while **NMEA / UBX** "
"determines the output format of positioning results. The two can be chosen "
"independently."

#: ../../source/rtk/overview.md:39
msgid ""
"详细选择和修改边界见[固件与输出协议选择](operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For detailed selection and modification of boundaries, see [Selecting "
"Firmware and Output Protocol](operation/firmware-output.md)."

